{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_no_meta",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "No change stamps",
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": false
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "ma_no_meta_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "This catalog carries no change stamps yet. They are read during the XML import — import the solution again to see which modules are alive and which rest."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_filters",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Filter"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "ma_file_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "file_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All files",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "multiple": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "ma_person_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "person_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "person",
                  "label": "Person",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All persons",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "NavButton",
                "id": "ma_filters_reset",
                "props": {
                  "label": "Reset filters",
                  "variant": "link",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "navigate",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "/dashboard/module_activity"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "FilterChips",
                "id": "ma_days_chips",
                "props": {
                  "param": "days",
                  "default": "365",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "value": "30",
                      "label": "30 days"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "90",
                      "label": "90 days"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "365",
                      "label": "365 days"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "all",
                      "label": "All"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "ToggleChips",
                "id": "ma_toggles",
                "props": {
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "param": "bulk",
                      "label": "Mass events",
                      "on": "include",
                      "off": "hide",
                      "default": "hide",
                      "resetParams": [
                        "page"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "param": "technical",
                      "label": "Technical authors",
                      "on": "include",
                      "off": "hide",
                      "default": "hide",
                      "resetParams": [
                        "page"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_file_modules",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Files stand in for modules"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "module_is_file",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "ma_file_modules_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "This catalog has no module partition — every file counts as one module. Segment the solution with the skill `fm-graph-cluster` to see the activity of the modules of the object graph."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_mass_hint",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Mass events dominate"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "mass_dominant",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "view_state"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "ma_mass_hint_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "For {{unknown_pct}} % of the module members the age of the last real change is unknown: their newest stamp comes from a mass event younger than two years, which overwrote the individual stamps. The class therefore says little per module. Sort the table *by saves* — the lifetime save counter is robust against mass events and shows where the work went."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_overview",
        "props": {
          "span": 12
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "ma_kpistrip",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "kpis"
            },
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Modules",
                  "field": "modules",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "module_activity",
                      "params": {
                        "state": "all"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Active ≤ 90 days",
                  "field": "active",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "module_activity",
                      "params": {
                        "state": "active"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Resting > 2 years",
                  "field": "resting",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "module_activity",
                      "params": {
                        "state": "resting"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Unknown",
                  "field": "unknown",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "module_activity",
                      "params": {
                        "state": "unknown"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Objects without module",
                  "field": "without_module",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_selected",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Selected module"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "module_selected",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "module_detail"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Markdown",
                "id": "ma_selected_md",
                "props": {
                  "content": "**{{module_name}}** — {{members}} members in {{file_count}} file(s). Click *Members* to open the module in the Graph Atlas, *Changes* to list the changes of its files."
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "NavButton",
                "id": "ma_selected_clear",
                "props": {
                  "label": "Clear selection",
                  "variant": "link",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "module_activity",
                      "params": {
                        "module": ""
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "ma_selected_kpis",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Activity",
                  "field": "activity",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "badgeTone": {
                    "≤ 30 days": "ok",
                    "≤ 90 days": "ok",
                    "≤ 1 year": "partial",
                    "Unknown": "warning",
                    "> 2 years": "none",
                    "No stamp": "none"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Newest change",
                  "field": "newest_date"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Members",
                  "field": "members",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "navigate",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "{{atlas_path}}"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Changes",
                  "field": "changes",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "changes",
                      "params": {
                        "file": "{{module_files}}",
                        "days": "{{days}}",
                        "anchor": "{{anchor}}",
                        "technical": "{{technical}}",
                        "bulk": "{{bulk}}"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Active ≤ 90 days (%)",
                  "field": "active_90_pct",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Median age (days)",
                  "field": "median_age_days",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Median saves",
                  "field": "median_saves",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Mass stamps (%)",
                  "field": "undated_pct",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_modules",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Modules",
          "subtitle": "Every module of the cluster partition, classed by the newest individual change of a member. Click a module to see its figures and links."
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "FilterChips",
                "id": "ma_state_chips",
                "props": {
                  "param": "state",
                  "default": "all",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "value": "all",
                      "label": "All"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "active",
                      "label": "≤ 90 days"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "aging",
                      "label": "≤ 2 years"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "resting",
                      "label": "> 2 years"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "unknown",
                      "label": "Unknown"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "none",
                      "label": "No stamp"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "FilterChips",
                "id": "ma_sort_chips",
                "props": {
                  "param": "sort",
                  "default": "activity",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "value": "activity",
                      "label": "By activity"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "saves",
                      "label": "By saves"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "changes",
                      "label": "By changes"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "ma_modules_table",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "modules"
            },
            "props": {
              "density": "compact",
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "mq",
              "sortable": true,
              "sortParam": "msort",
              "searchable": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search module",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "module_name",
                  "label": "Module"
                },
                {
                  "field": "members",
                  "label": "Members",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "activity",
                  "label": "Activity",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "badgeTone": {
                    "≤ 30 days": "ok",
                    "≤ 90 days": "ok",
                    "≤ 1 year": "partial",
                    "Unknown": "warning",
                    "> 2 years": "none",
                    "No stamp": "none"
                  },
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "newest_date",
                  "label": "Newest change",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "changes",
                  "label": "Changes",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "person_label",
                  "label": "Persons"
                },
                {
                  "field": "active_90_pct",
                  "label": "Active ≤ 90 days (%)",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "median_saves",
                  "label": "Median saves",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "undated_pct",
                  "label": "Mass stamps (%)",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "module_activity",
                  "params": {
                    "module": "{{module_key}}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No module matches these filters."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_activity",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Changes by module"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "ma_count_chips",
            "props": {
              "param": "count",
              "default": "objects",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "objects",
                  "label": "Count objects"
                },
                {
                  "value": "actions",
                  "label": "Count actions"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "StackedTimeSeries",
            "id": "ma_series",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "activity_series"
            },
            "props": {
              "height": 220,
              "ariaLabel": "Changes over time, stacked by module",
              "onBarClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "changes",
                  "from": "{{from_at}}",
                  "to": "{{to_at}}",
                  "bulk": "{{bulk_mode}}"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "ma_activity_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "The seven modules with the most individual changes of the solution keep their colour in every period; the others are summed up. Click a column to list its changes in *Recent changes*."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ma_basis",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Data basis"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "view_state"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "ma_basis_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "The **activity** of a module is the age of its newest individual change, counted back from the data state ({{data_state}}): ≤ 30 days, ≤ 90 days, ≤ 1 year, ≤ 2 years or > 2 years — the same classes as in the Graph Atlas. Mass events and technical authors overwrite the last real stamp: such a stamp younger than two years leaves the age **unknown**, never young; an older one still proves > 2 years. With *Mass events* switched on, every stamp counts as a change. Each object keeps only its last stamp, so the classes show the last state, not a history. **Median saves** is the median of the lifetime save counter of the members; *by saves* ranks the modules by the mean rank of that counter within each object type. *Changes* and *Persons* count the stamps of the period with the filters applied."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
